Source af55a509a17ff43e8b055085ab6d6c0306c98b2bec3d0ac909ac0ad6053a081b.
Assembly 08c55a2ce4fb340ef99a35dd1220fd5d9d9f08664c05890b5dd8effb1315e2e8;
byte-identical to the native-tested debug emission. Both interpreters return 0.
Existing elf-lifecycle.c MODE=0/1/2/3 replay passes with both native assemblers,
including exact stdout and absence of finalization after _Exit/quick_exit.
elf-lifecycle-library.c + elf-lifecycle-driver.c also pass with each assembler:
